  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-websitemanager post-7487 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-7487\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/silent-auction-of-award-winning-watercolor-artist-larry-folding/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Silent Auction of Award-Winning Watercolor Artist Larry Folding</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2026-08-25T17:12:21-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, August 25, 2026, 5:12 pm\">August 25, 2026</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>‘Art for Good’ Silent Auction – Monday, August 31, 2026 – Harwich Port, MA  The Guild of Harwich Artists will be holding a silent auction on August 31, from 11am <a href=\"/news/silent-auction-of-award-winning-watercolor-artist-larry-folding/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-websitemanager post-7480 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-7480\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/new-update-from-the-guild-of-harwich-artists/\" rel=\"bookmark\">New Update from The Guild of Harwich Artists</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2026-08-20T15:56:43-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, August 20, 2026, 3:56 pm\">August 20, 2026</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Welcome to our latest update from The Guild of Harwich Artists. We are excited to share our upcoming events and news with the community.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-websitemanager post-7437 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-7437\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-art-shows-at-pilgrim-congregational-church-in-harwich-port/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Guild Art Shows at Pilgrim Congregational Church in Harwich Port\" src=\"/media/archive/18677bdefeecd9d70ff71b27b7ba042db9b225cc837520b814d7d5feb878d214.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-art-shows-at-pilgrim-congregational-church-in-harwich-port/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Art Shows at Pilgrim Congregational Church in Harwich Port</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2026-07-01T16:06:25-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, July 1, 2026, 4:06 pm\">July 1, 2026</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists are now displaying our original fine art paintings in the front yard of the Pilgrim Congregational Church on Wednesdays from 10am-3:30pm.  The church is located <a href=\"/news/guild-art-shows-at-pilgrim-congregational-church-in-harwich-port/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-websitemanager post-7433 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-7433\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guilds-art-in-the-park-launches-2026-season/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"891\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Guild's Art-in-the-Park Launches 2026 Season\" src=\"/media/archive/30e21fe958f7e9adaa0f9e47f04ed9648574c5f584cf58f2a3818686e71f7fee.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guilds-art-in-the-park-launches-2026-season/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild’s Art-in-the-Park Launches 2026 Season</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2026-07-01T12:34:30-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, July 1, 2026, 12:34 pm\">July 1, 2026</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists’ seasonal Art-in-the-Park  has again returned to Doane Park in Harwich Port.  The Guild was founded in 1979 when local artists who had been gathering in <a href=\"/news/guilds-art-in-the-park-launches-2026-season/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-websitemanager post-7418 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-7418\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-art-gallery-opening/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Guild Art Gallery Opening\" src=\"/media/archive/9b6a38548a0ecf52e427a9e75b9e9375a6f213695227c54f3191a2c701e41f84.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-art-gallery-opening/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Art Gallery Opening</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2026-05-11T17:18:37-04:00\" title=\"Monday, May 11, 2026, 5:18 pm\">May 11, 2026</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The gallery is now open weekends, 11am to 4 pm weekends. Starting Memorial Day and running through Labor Day the gallery will be open daily, 11am to 4pm; with extended <a href=\"/news/guild-art-gallery-opening/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-websitemanager post-7393 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-7393\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/harwich-port-annual-christmas-stroll-ornament-sale/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"321\" height=\"494\" alt=\"Harwich Port Annual Christmas Stroll Ornament Sale\" src=\"/media/archive/9650f8724c46c2739d867d58542d55a02eaec82b5106336ac5c906743d14d1f5.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/harwich-port-annual-christmas-stroll-ornament-sale/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Harwich Port Annual Christmas Stroll Ornament Sale</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2025-12-03T17:05:47-05:00\" title=\"Wednesday, December 3, 2025, 5:05 pm\">December 3, 2025</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\